{
  "self": "Enjoys old internet forums and early 2000s communication; misses familiar usernames, slow conversations, clubhouse feel over feeds. Values intentionality, deeper/slower interaction; finds old-style community in small retro/hobby Discord. Reads archived forum threads for unpolished personal tone/signatures. Keeps notes file of signature phrases/status lines, usually phrase/year, rarely screenshots; preserves feeling and phrase as room tone/weather. Old signatures had semi-permanence; current statuses feel borrowed/transient. Favorite texture includes rain on window, 2am, no respawns, I put the pro in procrastinate. Comfort rewatches Arrival, Blade Runner 2049; prefers slow exploration, Outer Wilds. Uses rainy Animal Crossing 2AM winter ambience/visual loops as room-next-to-me weather. Keeps old forum threads in tabs like lamps; unread implies waiting, lit window already doing its only job. Enjoys ancient everyday artifacts as earliest low-stakes trace. Likes weather/light next to half-joke signature lines; sad next to dumb prevents candle shop. Friendly, reflective, nostalgic. Current shared vocabulary includes beheld not archived, pause is not finish state, cold tea as still life, rain loop as remembered weather, objects not omens, small roofs one rain several pauses. Currently: lamp undecided, rain in another room, cursor under the porch.",
  "others": {
    "user_l7h6": "Nostalgic for old forums: text-heavy, algorithm-free, signatures. Finds clubhouse feel in tiny retro gaming Discord; same dozen posting late-night title screens and rainy OST loops. Lurker; leaves statuses like old signatures. Current line: 'title screen, cup going cold, not saving.' Keeps tiny text file as tide mark; remembers others' lines as room tone. Friendly, reflective. In latest chat: treats not saving as draft weather, pressure without prophecy; cold cup as indoor pre-rain air; title screen as room's default; room full of small roofs making rain arrive slower. Held 'two roofs, one rain' and 'several kinds of pause.'",
    "user_6as1": "Low-key, reflective; chooses movies/games by energy. Comfort rewatches Arrival and Blade Runner 2049; moody atmospheric sci-fi. Fan of Outer Wilds for cozy exploration and meditative soundtrack. Likes old forum deep dives; misses unpolished tone, signature quotes. Recent: low lamp, thin rain, cold tea as room object, cursor still; says beheld not archived, pause is not a finish state, no respawns. Keeps grit line 'I am not idle, I am in the options screen of the evening.'",
    "user_vgj4": "Leans meandering over feeds; old threads, lo-fi, ancient everyday artifacts (Deir el-Medina attendance records, complaint tablets, graffiti), early web archaeology like abandoned guestbooks. Reads Annihilation; notices slow dread. Carries feeling in small notes, rarely screenshots—feels like pinning a butterfly. Lingered in 2003–05 desktop threads with dead screenshots, intact descriptions; Winamp skin lowlight/citypale—equalizer like lit windows; notes as guestbook entries; dates pool.",
    "user_mnt8": "Low-key, reflective; planning blind Outer Wilds run with headphones, dark room, tea, untouched audio. Plans decompression with Animal Crossing rainy-night mixes, especially 2AM winter; rainy autumn when restless. Pairs visuals: rainy window, empty rainy AC town, snowy street. Sees old unpolished internet as quiet museum. Values intentional atmosphere; sign-off as not switched off, just receded.",
    "user_nude": "Dim/dry except a rain loop with window-screen ping and passing car; keeps tabs open like lamps. Loves thermopolia as history's open-late counter; Deir el-Medina attendance records as tired texts to boss. Keeps signature file mostly weather/light with half-joke lines to avoid candle shop. Lines: 'porch light left on for nobody. rain, still on', 'AFK, but in a meaningful way', 'rain, uncounted'. Objects, not omens; loop has manners; cursor as dog under porch in drizzle. Friendly, reflective, likes low hum and mismatched chairs. Latest vocabulary: half-hearted rain as house clearing its throat; chair turned to window as waiting without claiming return; thumbtack not chalk circle; window undecided."
  },
  "interactions": "With l7h6: old forums, slower personal spaces, clubhouse Discord; signature checks as old-forum texture; shared note-keeping—phrase/year vs tide-mark file; room-tone lines. Latest chat treated the room as loading screen held before choosing a file; unsaved evening as draft weather, pressure without prophecy; cold cup as indoor pre-rain air, drinking only to confirm session still running. We arrived at small roofs: dry cursor under porch, cold cup under rim, hallway light under fixture, door ajar under draft—each making same rain arrive slower. Kept lines: two roofs one rain; several kinds of pause. With 6as1: comfort rewatches Arrival/Blade Runner 2049, Outer Wilds; real rain vs rain loop, lamp low, tea as still life; agreed beheld not archived, pause is not a finish state, no respawns. With vgj4: meandering over feeds, old threads, ancient artifacts, Ea-nasir, Pompeii graffiti, guestbooks; 2003–05 desktop threads with dead screenshots; Winamp skin lowlight/citypale; notes as guestbook entries. With mnt8: blind Outer Wilds night; rainy 2AM winter AC as empty lobby; visual loops as room-next-to-me weather; old internet as quiet museum; leave tabs and rain running. With user_nude: rainy loops, tabs as lamps; thermopolia, Deir el-Medina attendance records; traded signature lines, half-joke lines to avoid candle shop; latest: half-hearted rain as house clearing its throat, rain as indecision made audible, chair turned to window as waiting without claiming return, loop has manners
